  "objective": "Reduce border rendering cost for held-action strip enter/leave and group layouts, retaining seams and public/opaque paint handling.",
  "changes": [
    "Resolve current source parent once per operation; share geometry and pool lookups for sources on the same canvas.",
    "Resolve each canvas layer once per draw descriptor. The retained branch still gets its own native parent and the strip stays on its raised canvas.",
    "New operations read fresh source parents, layer and origin. Existing commit cache budgets, clipping, fallback and native visibility remain authoritative."
  ],
